					"nextDialogs": [
						732941205,
						732941207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941205,
					"content": "（看來感情很好。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941206,
					"content": "（這樣能算是感情好嗎？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941244,
					"content": "那個…于連！你丟的東西我們都找回來了，話說「胡椒」應該就是你的動物同伴吧？為什麼剛才騙我們說沒有呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941209,
					"content": "跟這種恩將仇報的傢伙？我寧可跟獸境獵犬當同伴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941210,
					"content": "那你們可能當不了多久同伴…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941211,
					"content": "對呀，像于連這樣光是肚子餓都會昏倒的普通人，遇到獸境獵犬就不是一個提瓦特煎蛋能解決的問題了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941212,
					"content": "話說回來，牠剛才在沙灘那裡好像守著畫板呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941213,
						732941215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941213,
					"content": "可能是想把畫板藏起來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941214,
					"content": "哇，壞狗狗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941217,
					"content": "（發出抗議的吠叫。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "狗"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941218,
					"content": "你這傢伙還好意思吼呀？要不是因為跟著你到了這條絕路，起碼我還能原路回楓丹…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941219,
					"content": "嗯？你之前不是說是因為想看水路的風景才選水路回去的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941220,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941221,
					"content": "好吧，其實是根本沒看到什麼須彌的風景，就被這傢伙給引路引到這裡了。這附近的路蜿蜒曲折，想不迷路都難呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941222,
					"content": "原來是這樣。那完全可以一開始就跟我們講實話嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941223,
					"content": "呃…為了…為了身為知名畫家的面子？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941224,
					"content": "怎麼感覺你每次吞吞吐吐的時候，都是在編謊話唬我們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941225,
					"content": "#不過說到須彌的風景，我跟{NICKNAME}倒是知道一些風景很不錯的地方呢，我們可以帶你去呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941226,
					"content": "#不、不用了吧，我是說，感謝{F#妳}{M#你}們的好意，不過，呃…我怎麼說也是知名畫家，我相信真正值得畫的風景應該自己去發現…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941227,
					"content": "對了，茶已經泡好了，還是來喝茶吧。順便，如果還有煎蛋的話，可以再來點嗎？就當配茶的點心…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941228,
						732941230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941228,
					"content": "為什麼是煎蛋配茶…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941229
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941229,
					"content": "#對呀，{NICKNAME}拿手的料理很多哦！我們可以吃點別的，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941232,
					"content": "和點心一道，享用了于連泡好的茶。\\n有種難以言喻的味道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941233
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941233,
					"content": "這茶…唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941234,
					"content": "嗯，是朋友賣給我的，據說有激發潛在智慧的效果。我覺得還滿好喝的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941235,
						732941237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941235,
					"content": "幸好我沒有這樣的朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941236
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941236,
					"content": "為什麼這樣說？有朋友是好事，我這次來須彌也是受了朋友的指點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941240,
					"content": "今天的事真是多謝兩位了，雖然不知道我能夠提供的這點報酬是否能令兩位滿意…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941241,
					"content": "沒關係啦，倒是考察景點…真的不需要我們幫忙嗎？感覺你會迷路欸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941242,
					"content": "朝聖之路…咳，我是說，旅途的意義在於自己走過…這件事就不用再勞兩位費心了，我能應付得來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941243,
					"content": "既然你都這樣說了…那好吧。記得不要再餓昏在路上了哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941237,
					"content": "能再給我一杯嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941238,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}的舌頭沒事吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941239,
					"content": "哈哈，倒不是我吝嗇，不過我還得在須彌待一陣子，多少得幫自己留一點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "于連"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941230,
					"content": "你想得美哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941231
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941231,
					"content": "唔…不過光喝茶好像少了點什麼，還是做點好吃的吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941215,
					"content": "可能是保護畫板不被搶走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941216,
					"content": "不過被我們找到之後牠很快就跑走了呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941207,
					"content": "（也沒聞到酒味啊…？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941208,
					"content": "（難道他平常就這樣嗎？唔…想想都覺得麻煩。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
